  "title": "Simon 7.5.8: regularity of codimension-one minimizing boundaries",
  "statement": "CodimensionOneRegularity of the frozen contract (Simon 7.5.8, with README erratum 7). For all n, k ∈ ℕ, all sets U, N, E ⊆ ℝ^{n+k}, every map ξ_N : ℝ^{n+k} → Λ_{n+1}(ℝ^{n+k}) (MultiVector (n+k) (n+1)) and every T ∈ 𝒟_n(U): if U is open, InClassO n U N ξ_N (N an embedded C² (n+1)-dimensional submanifold, ξ_N a continuous orientation of N, (closure N ∖ N) ∩ U = ∅, N ∩ U ≠ ∅), E is a measurable set with E ⊆ N ∩ U, T(ω) = ∫_E ξ_N(x)(dω(x)) dH^{n+1}(x) for every ω ∈ 𝒟^n(U) (IsBoundaryOfRegion T E ξ_N), and T is minimizing in N ∩ U, then: (a) singularSet T = ∅ if n ≤ 6; (b) singularSet T ∩ K is finite for every compact K ⊆ U if n = 7; (c) μH[n − 7 + α](singularSet T) = 0 for every real α > 0 if n > 7.",
